# M12: the Save changes question in the mono scheme: the focused button is the one in normal video.
@mono
@copy plain.qld
@open PLAIN.QLD
x
f10 end enter                     # File > Exit asks to save
left                              # Cancel (the focus wraps)
left                              # No
esc                               # back to the document
f10 end enter
y                                 # Yes: save and exit
